<title>HUNGARY: BASKETBALL-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the women's European</p>
<p>basketball championship final round played Tuesday night:</p>
<p>Group A (played in Zalaegerszeg):</p>
<p>Germany beat Czech Republic 85-65 (halftime 40-32)</p>
<p>Spain beat Yugoslavia 86-71 (44-37)</p>
<p>Group B (played in Pecs):</p>
<p>Hungary beat Slovakia 73-54 (44-27)</p>
<p>Bosnia-Herzegovina beat Italy 97-79 (46-53)</p>
</text>
